EXIT=0
--- STDOUT ---
freemkv <VER>

Usage: freemkv update-keys --url <url>

Download, verify, and install an AACS keydb (.txt / .zip / .gz). Only Blu-ray and UHD (AACS) discs need a keydb; DVDs (CSS) need none. --url is required.

Examples:
  freemkv update-keys --url http://example.org/keydb_eng.zip

Flags:
  -u, --url URL    Source URL for the keydb archive (required).
